[l_english.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_CONTEMPORARY_RIFLE]
Contemporary Rifle (Infantry)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_CONTEMPORARY_RIFLE_desc]
The contemporary rifle, a weapon so cutting-edge that it makes even the most tech-savvy unicorns question their magical abilities. Mastering a rifle is way lot easier than mastering a spell turning your enemy into a cute and delicate little coffee cup filled with Caffè Mocha con Schiuma di Latte e Caramello. Afterall, you don’t need to worry about latte art when you’re shooting at a target.
§g“Shoot responsibly. This gun can seriously damage your health, although there is no deterministic evidence of such causal link.”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_CONTEMPORARY_RIFLE_short]
Contemporary Rifle

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_CONTEMPORARY_RIFLE]
现代步枪 (步兵装备)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_CONTEMPORARY_RIFLE_desc]
现代步枪，一种如此尖端的武器，以至于即使是最懂技术的独角兽也会质疑他们自己的魔法能力。掌握步枪比掌握将敌军变成一只可爱、精致、装满摩卡咖啡、配着奶泡和焦糖的小咖啡杯的法术要容易得多。毕竟，射击目标的时候不需要考虑拉花的艺术。
§g“适量射击。这把枪可能对您的健康造成严重不良影响，尽管没有确定的证据证明这种因果关系。”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_CONTEMPORARY_RIFLE_short]
现代步枪
